**1. Questions About the Hearing Format & Expectations**
* "What is the standard procedure for this type of hearing, and what exactly will my role be?"
* "Will I be expected to testify or speak directly to the judge, or will you be doing most of the talking?"
* "How long do you expect the hearing to last?"

