* *"What is the opposing counsel's likely strategy, and what are the weakest points in our case that they will try to exploit?"*
* *"What specific questions will the other parent's attorney likely ask me during cross-examination?"*
* *"How should I handle questions from opposing counsel if they try to provoke me or ask about sensitive topics?"*

