*   "What factors or legal standards is the judge in Denver County most likely to focus on for this specific type of hearing?"
*   "Are there any weaknesses or gaps in our case that the judge might press us on? How should we address them?"
*   "What is the judge's typical temperament or approach in cases like this?"

### 5. Hearing Preparation & Next Steps
*   "Will I be required to testify or speak directly to the judge at this hearing, or will you be doing all the speaking?"
*   "Can we schedule a dedicated preparation session or a mock Q&A before the hearing date so I can practice my responses?"
